      "text": "Solar Power on the Red Planet: Ingenuity, InSight, and Perseverance (Mars)\n\nSolAero, acquired by Rocket Lab in 2022, has powered several landmark Mars exploration missions, including:\n\n- Ingenuity Mars Helicopter: Powered by our solar panel — populated with ultra-lightweight, 33% efficient Inverted Metamorphic Multijunction (IMM) solar cells — mounted atop its rotor blades.\n\n- InSight Lander: Our high-efficiency solar panels powered Northrop Grumman's UltraFlex solar arrays in support of the lander's seismic operations on the Martian surface.\n\n- Mars 2020 Cruise Stage: Our solar panels kept Perseverance powered and healthy during its months-long transit to Mars.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
