      "type": "原文",
      "type_label": "原文",
      "text": "Think Rocket Lab only operates in low Earth orbit? Think again.\n\nWhen a spacecraft orbits the Moon, touches down on the lunar surface, or charts a course across deep space to Mars, there's a strong chance Rocket Lab technology helped it get there and deliver mission success.\n\nThrough our launch, spacecraft, solar power, separation systems, software, operations, and robotics solutions, we’re proud to support historic planetary exploration missions across the solar system. 🧵👇",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": null,
