      "text": "Kickoff complete! Our team recently wrapped up a successful program kickoff for the Space-Based Airborne Moving Target Indicator (SB-AMTI) demonstrations in support of @USSpaceForce. \n\nWe’re delivering Flatellites with innovative space-based sensing technologies to help mature resilient capabilities for the Joint Force.",
