      "text": "A reminder to apply for our upcoming Wallops hiring event. \n\nWe want to hear from engineers and technicians with experience in:\n✅Testing – Vehicle, Avionics, Ground Systems \n✅Vehicle Integration \n✅Mechanical \n✅Fluids\n✅Propulsion",
      "quote": {
        "author": "RocketLab",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1494443717452709900/Y7Lg2mm__200x200.jpg",
